# Report a Bug page. Never press Send report, Open on GitHub or Mark up. Clear boxes at the end.
ipc panels settings about/bugreport
wait 2
shot bug-top
note BR1 same groups, rows, texts and "Send report" state as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
shot bug-end
note BR1 end of the page: same groups, rows and texts as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 -30
wait 1
ptr move 1100 450 sleep 300 glide 1100 450 100
wait 1
shot bug-hover
note BR3 (Material) pointer over an unfocused box tints it (QML does; batch 3 added in Rust). Box position is a guess: read from bug-top.
ptr move 1100 450 sleep 200 glide 1100 450 100 click
key one
key -k Return
key two
key -k Return
key three
key -k Return
key four
key -k Return
key five
key -k Return
key six
key -k Return
key seven
key -k Return
key eight
wait 1
shot bug-box
note BR2 the box scrolls and the cursor's line (eight) is visible; same as QML (batch 3: boxes scroll and follow the caret).
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl -k Delete
wait 1
shot bug-cleared
note BR5 the box is empty again (placeholder shown).
# MANUAL: BR4 Tessera log > Show gives a 200 px dark box with the log, Hide; System info > Show a 140 px box, Hide; switch the log's switch off and on
# MANUAL: BR5 clear the Title field too
ipc panels close
